<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"> <head> <meta charset="utf-8"> <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes" name="viewport"> <title>paragraph_format</title> </head> <body> <main> <h1 id="sec:local-paragraph-formatting">1 Local paragraph formatting</h1> <p>Control before the formatted block.</p> <div data-custom-style="Quote" data-somekey="preserved" id="local-format"> <p>Outer paragraph with <strong>bold words</strong>, <em>emphasis</em>, <span data-custom-style="Revision Char">revision words</span>, and <a href="https://example.org">a link</a>.</p> <p>Another outer paragraph with a note.<a href="#fn1" id="fnref1" role="doc-noteref">
<sup>1</sup>
</a>
</p> <div> <p data-custom-style="Quote">Inner paragraph inherits size, color, font and exact line spacing.</p> </div> <p>Outer paragraph after the nested block.</p> <ul> <li>
<p data-custom-style="Quote">First list paragraph.</p>
</li> <li>
<p data-custom-style="Quote">Second list paragraph.</p>
</li> </ul> <blockquote> <p data-custom-style="Quote">Quoted paragraph.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id="sec:heading-keeps-its-own-format">1.1 Heading keeps its own format</h2> <pre>
<code>Code keeps its own format.</code>
</pre>
<table> <caption>Table keeps its own format.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>Item</th> <th>Value</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Cell</td> <td>Text</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>
<span>
<span class="display math">z = x + y\tag{1}</span>
</span>
</p> </div> <p>Control after the formatted block with a <a href="#local-format">jump</a>.</p> <div> <p data-custom-style="Body Text">Chinese Word size and proportional line spacing.</p> </div> <div> <p data-custom-style="Body Text">Only the font size changes; ordinary paragraph spacing and indentation remain.</p> </div> <div> <p data-custom-style="Body Text">One-character local first-line indent.</p> </div> <div> <p data-custom-style="Body Text">Local physical hanging indent.</p> </div> <section id="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes"> <hr> <ol> <li id="fn1"> <p>A note keeps its own formatting.</p> <div> <p data-custom-style="Footnote Text">Explicitly formatted note paragraph.</p> </div> <a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink">↩︎</a> </li> </ol> </section> </main> </body> </html>
